# Production build. No domain is written down here: the customer site (e.g. metrofix.<your-domain>)
# and the staff site (admin.metrofix.<your-domain>) both find their API at api.metrofix.<your-domain>
# by themselves. Set these only if your hosting differs.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com        full API address (overrides the automatic one)
# VITE_ADMIN_SUBDOMAIN=admin                  first label (or prefix) that marks the staff site
# VITE_HOST_STYLE=dash                        dash: admin-<site> + api-<site> (one level below the domain); default dot: admin.<site> + api.<site>
# VITE_SURFACE=customer                       force one audience (admin | customer | any)
# VITE_ADMIN_SITE_URL=https://admin-metrofix.example.lk     address of the staff site, if it is not admin.<site>
# VITE_CUSTOMER_SITE_URL=https://metrofix.example.lk          address of the customer site, if it is not <site>
